Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.08,0:00:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,So it doesn't show up, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.37,0:00:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Machines are no good, then.\NOnly living creatures can perceive them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.45,0:00:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems I'll need humans to help me find them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.41,0:00:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.54,0:00:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The inhabitants of this\Nplanet are all good people.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.66,0:00:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure they'll find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.45,0:02:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a total Sunday.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.00,0:02:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What makes it a "total" Sunday?\NCan you explain?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.87,0:02:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your problem? I was only trying\Nto create a relaxing mood for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.33,0:02:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need a relaxing mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.33,0:02:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.08,0:02:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine then. You're so impatient.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.95,0:02:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Whaaaa--!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.58,0:02:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.75,0:02:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you taking your clothes off?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.25,0:03:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Why? I'm about to get inside of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.45,0:03:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You brought it up...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.08,0:03:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do I transform? And what\Ndo the coins have to do with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.41,0:03:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You said you wanted to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.12,0:03:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But if we're going to go down that path,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.33,0:03:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,it means we might run into\Nanother monster like that girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.87,0:03:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why we need to figure out exactly what
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.87,0:03:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,we're capable of together,\Nright now, while we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.79,0:03:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're in, hurry up and\Nturn into the doggy, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.20,0:03:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I will, but-- Doggy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.33,0:03:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm still not sure why you\Nhave to take your clothes off.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.20,0:03:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.16,0:03:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, Shuichi...\NYour insides are stuffy as hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.87,0:03:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You are a costume, after all.\NIf it was winter, it'd be nice and warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.29,0:03:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But right now it's summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.00,0:03:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,My underwear will get\Ntotally drenched with sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.08,0:04:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And they'll get your slimy liquid all over them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.75,0:04:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but still,\Ngetting inside of me naked is...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.00,0:04:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it!\NWe've already gone that far once, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.41,0:04:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, "gone that far"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.41,0:04:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's become one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.91,0:04:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.75,0:04:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, this is so lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.00,0:04:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-That should be fine, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.75,0:04:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no problem if a swimsuit gets wet,\Nand it's easy to wash.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.33,0:04:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you'd rather have me\Nwear a school swimsuit than be naked.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.75,0:04:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess everyone has a fetish.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.20,0:04:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not what this is about!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.37,0:04:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.75,0:04:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.70,0:04:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, there's still nothing there. Empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.83,0:04:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.12,0:04:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, I'm coming in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.08,0:04:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay, Shuichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.79,0:05:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Just relax. I'll be gentle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.75,0:05:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,This feeling... It's the same as before.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.25,0:05:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel her inside of me so clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.95,0:05:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I can feel your anxiety.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.12,0:05:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just like it was my own body.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.75,0:05:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's weird, but I feel like I could move\Nin ways I'd never be able to normally.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.54,0:05:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,How is it for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.70,0:05:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you move by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.33,0:05:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me try.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.25,0:05:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, my body is being moved! Gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.16,0:05:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels gross for me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.62,0:05:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Shuichi.\NCan you grab that cup over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.12,0:05:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.41,0:05:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell? My body won't--
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.45,0:05:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm stopping you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.33,0:05:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.58,0:06:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like I have more\Ncontrol over movement than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.33,0:06:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll take the left hand,\Nyou take the right,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.54,0:06:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,and we'll see who can grab the cup the fastest.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.87,0:06:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.91,0:06:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. Ready? Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.16,0:06:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Tickle tickle tickle!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.75,0:06:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What-- Clair, stop it, I--
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.83,0:06:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on little guy, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.33,0:06:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, not there!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.83,0:06:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Here? How's here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.54,0:06:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That's better.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.58,0:06:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you had a fetish, weirdo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.08,0:06:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Shuichi, could you grab one\Nof the things in the fridge for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.33,0:06:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.16,0:06:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you keeping these cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.58,0:06:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? It's good during the summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.45,0:06:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, on to the next problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.91,0:07:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.41,0:07:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,My sister's school uniform is in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.91,0:07:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I noticed when I first went inside of you--
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.83,0:07:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You have a powerful sense of smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.41,0:07:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Even in the dark,\NI could tell where everything was;
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.45,0:07:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,the same as though it was right before my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.25,0:07:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only that, you can smell things\Nthat are nowhere near you,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.33,0:07:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,and distinguish smells\Nwell enough to follow people.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.62,0:07:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,With that nose, we can find my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.04,0:07:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,This might be my personal goal,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.95,0:07:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,but seeing as how we have\Nno other information on these monsters,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.00,0:07:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,finding her will be very valuable for you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.45,0:07:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Clair's sister...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.37,0:07:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Clair said she killed their parents,\Nthen disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.45,0:07:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I ask you something?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.50,0:07:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.75,0:08:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you actually see\Nyour sister kill your parents?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.20,0:08:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't. But...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.25,0:08:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Six months ago, I came home from school,\Nand our house was in shambles.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.83,0:08:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Standing there was a monster\Nthat seemed like my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.54,0:08:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Elena... Is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.41,0:08:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.16,0:08:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And next to her were my parents' corpses.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.83,0:08:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that enough circumstantial evidence?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.62,0:08:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I can sense Clair's feelings, if only slightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.66,0:08:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Is she feeling anxious? Lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.58,0:08:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Or does she still feel that her sister--
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.54,0:08:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Shuichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.16,0:08:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand. That's right. I need to know...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.66,0:09:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Why I take this form.\NWhy that person attacked me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.12,0:09:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And... The reason for the crime we committed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.20,0:09:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That smell...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.95,0:09:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,The smell of blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.45,0:09:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's not just one or two people...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.87,0:09:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,How many lives were lost?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.25,0:09:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been naïve.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.16,0:09:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter whether Clair saw it or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.58,0:09:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's completely clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.12,0:09:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The one that killed Clair's parents...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.50,0:09:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,...was this beast!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.66,0:10:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I thought I was prepared for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.29,0:10:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But it looks like the situation\Nis worse than I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.62,0:10:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Shuichi, what will you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.08,0:10:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Look for her. Together.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.41,0:10:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.79,0:10:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Food, water. And a memory card.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.04,0:10:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right! Should we get a portable toilet?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.79,0:10:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never been on a stakeout\Nbefore, so I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.41,0:10:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think we need that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.58,0:10:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, in the worst case,\NI can just use a plastic bottle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.45,0:10:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You think two per person is enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.20,0:10:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.08,0:10:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh... Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.08,0:10:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.87,0:10:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you like me to heat this up?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.66,0:10:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.95,0:11:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you heat that up too?\NOpen it up first though, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.12,0:11:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.50,0:11:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You said you liked it cold earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.66,0:11:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The maple flavor is better when you heat it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.12,0:11:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you going to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.79,0:11:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,That smell, it's still...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.33,0:11:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But we can't do our stakeout if you don't eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.62,0:11:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.12,0:11:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly though, I'm surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.91,0:11:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,When you smelled\Nmy sister's scent, even I felt fear--
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.66,0:11:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,But you still said you wanted\Nto look for her, together.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.37,0:11:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to say that's not like me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.04,0:11:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Not at all. It was cool of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.87,0:11:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Clair.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.91,0:11:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.58,0:11:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you planning\Nto do if we find your sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.08,0:12:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm. I just want to ask her...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.33,0:12:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Why she turned into a monster.\NWhy she killed our mom and dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.66,0:12:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.33,0:12:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,And?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.95,0:12:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind. Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.58,0:12:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What about you? What's your family like?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.75,0:12:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,My family? I guess we don't\Nspend a lot of time together.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.58,0:12:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,My parents are always working\Nand aren't home much.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.95,0:12:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And I was also sent to cram school.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.29,0:12:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, we're pretty much normal...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.70,0:12:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'd like to get tangled up\Nin all this as little as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.58,0:12:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.66,0:12:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.12,0:12:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.37,0:12:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh... Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.33,0:13:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, this is the third day.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.66,0:13:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Lots of people use this station,\Nand my sister's school is nearby, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.04,0:13:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We've picked up nothing so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.70,0:13:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe my intuition was off.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.91,0:13:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Shuichi, give me some water!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.33,0:13:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,We're out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.87,0:13:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I suspect my sister is still in this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.37,0:13:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,She might be a beast,\Nbut it's still hard for a high schooler
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.70,0:13:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,to live alone in a town\Nwhere she doesn't know anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.00,0:13:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You think someone is helping her?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.16,0:13:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.66,0:13:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But if someone has been in contact with her,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.12,0:13:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,that person should have her scent on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.87,0:13:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And if the scent is there,\Nyour nose should pick it up. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.33,0:13:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. I've got to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.29,0:13:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the only clue we have\Nthat might reveal my secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.62,0:13:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if we are after a beast...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.58,0:13:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.41,0:14:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I will find her!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.91,0:14:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right! We'll get that slut together!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.12,0:14:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! Is your sister a slut?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.33,0:14:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Well, I don't actually know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.75,0:14:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, I'm a virgin!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.04,0:14:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't asking!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.70,0:14:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess we should wrap it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.83,0:14:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Want to try looking at the mall tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.16,0:14:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,There are a lot of people there, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.33,0:14:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The mall, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.87,0:14:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.08,0:14:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing. I just remembered there's\Na movie playing that I want to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.66,0:14:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, it's not important.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.37,0:14:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got other things to think about.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.91,0:14:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go. I don't want\Nto see a scary movie, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.41,0:14:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not good with scary movies.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.54,0:14:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you want to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.16,0:15:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We need some time to relax, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.25,0:15:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened? You transformed out of nowhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.25,0:15:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.37,0:15:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you found someone who smells\Nlike my sister. Is it a boy? A girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.87,0:15:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,A girl. On the platform.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.79,0:15:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If it's a girl, it must be one of her classmates.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.04,0:15:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Not there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.16,0:15:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this smell?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.04,0:15:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Even from this far away... Just breathing in...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.29,0:15:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems to weigh me down...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.54,0:16:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,No good, Shuichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.29,0:16:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not my sister's classmate.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.95,0:16:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.83,0:16:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Is my sister herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.12,0:16:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That... is Clair's sister?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.66,0:16:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Shuichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.41,0:16:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on, Clair! What are we going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.00,0:16:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it obvious? We're going to capture her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.79,0:16:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Capture her?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.20,0:16:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,First, we'll shoot her\Nwith your gun, so she can't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.04,0:16:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoot her? Just like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.54,0:16:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Shuichi. She's killed many people.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.62,0:16:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,She's a murderous demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.54,0:16:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But she's your sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.91,0:16:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.25,0:17:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,So... Let me do it, alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.37,0:17:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.50,0:17:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.62,0:17:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you forget? I thought I told you...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.20,0:17:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We two are one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.45,0:17:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, Shuichi. We've only got one chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.83,0:17:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Clair... Are you sure\Nyou can't just talk to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.91,0:17:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You two are sisters!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.33,0:17:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk to the person who killed our parents?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.37,0:17:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll aim for her legs. I'll fire the gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.12,0:17:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.20,0:17:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,After she goes down, hit her and knock her out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.37,0:17:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we'll run off with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.00,0:17:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,How...?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.50,0:17:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,How can she stay so calm?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.29,0:17:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,She's about to meet the person\Nwho killed her parents...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.54,0:18:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,About to shoot her own sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.25,0:18:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't feel any emotion coming from her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.16,0:18:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,She's erased them...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.58,0:18:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Completely...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.00,0:18:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Erased all her feelings!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.62,0:18:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.62,0:18:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.08,0:18:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,She's touching me... I can feel it...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.12,0:18:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I am nothing compared to her!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.33,0:18:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you'd just shoot me like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.33,0:18:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,No! She'll kill--
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.37,0:19:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh... It's... I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.41,0:19:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not used to this. So... You see...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.00,0:19:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry... I need time to think...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.33,0:19:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, what should I do here?!\NWhat should I talk about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.12,0:19:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh god! He can totally tell\NI have communication problems!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.25,0:19:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What should I do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.83,0:19:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What the hell is with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.41,0:19:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I-It's okay. I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.58,0:19:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You've come to kill me, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.41,0:19:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, but, would you mind\Nif we do it somewhere else?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.25,0:19:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, somewhere it\Nwon't bother other people?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.87,0:19:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.62,0:19:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,She's nothing like the picture,\Nor Clair's description.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.20,0:20:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Is she really a murderous demon?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.12,0:20:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But... How did you find me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.04,0:20:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Did someone tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.20,0:20:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry!\NIt's nothing for you to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.50,0:20:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm talking too much again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.91,0:20:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like I can talk to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.70,0:20:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,She's not attacking us\Nlike the last girl we faced.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.87,0:20:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We even fired a gun at her,\Nand she's still so reserved!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.00,0:20:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand why you're\Ntrying to kill me. Completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.66,0:20:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And I know who you are, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.66,0:20:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. It's all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.75,0:20:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,She noticed? She could tell\Nthat I was inside of Shuichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.50,0:21:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I was weak. And that's why\Nyou got wrapped up in this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.45,0:21:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why... I don't mind if you kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.45,0:21:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.95,0:21:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Shuichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.79,0:21:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who made you take that form.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.91,0:21:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying...?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.54,0:21:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait... That sounded...\NThat sounded like... a girl's voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.83,0:21:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there a girl inside of you right now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.37,0:21:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Filthy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.20,0:21:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Disgusting!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.91,0:21:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.91,0:22:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That place...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.62,0:22:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,...belongs to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.33,0:23:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Episode 4: I Wish I Was Someone Else"
